DTSTAMP:20260604T022443Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260601
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260602
SUMMARY:Puriva Aesthetic Clinic — SEO Retainer Month 1 (10 tasks)
DESCRIPTION:Puriva Aesthetic Clinic — Month 1 SEO retainer tasks:\n- Re-submitted XML sitemap in Google Search Console.\n- Ran Screaming Frog site-wide crawl and patched identified broken links.\n- Updated monthly keyword tracking and ranking benchmarks in AWR.\n- Checked for any new manual actions or security flags in GSC.\n- Resolved redirect loops identified during the monthly crawl.\n- Verified robots.txt isn't blocking priority service pages.\n- Checked mobile layout for spacing issues on the homepage.\n- Monitored GSC for any sudden drops in organic impressions.\n- Audited footer links for consistency across all sub-pages.\n- Established baseline performance monitors in Search Console to track indexing health.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:dm-seo-retainer-puriva-aesthetic-clinic-m2@digitalmovement
DTSTAMP:20260604T022443Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260701
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260702
SUMMARY:Puriva Aesthetic Clinic — SEO Retainer Month 2 (10 tasks)
DESCRIPTION:Puriva Aesthetic Clinic — Month 2 SEO retainer tasks:\n- GA4 traffic audience audit to identify if website is qualified to setup traffic security rules.\n- Analysed traffic logs for bot-driven search volume spikes.\n- Verified all GTM conversion tags are firing for lead forms.\n- Monitored GSC 'crawled/discovered but not indexed' report for crawling gaps.\n- Verified internal traffic filter is still blocking office IPs.\n- Audited GA4 property settings to ensure data streams and attribution models are correctly configured.\n- Audited internal search queries for missing service keywords.\n- Verified GTM triggers are firing for all localised contact form variants.\n- Cross-referenced enquiry form hits with actual inbox data.\n- Adjusted GA4 data retention settings for better long-term reporting.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:dm-seo-retainer-puriva-aesthetic-clinic-m3@digitalmovement
DTSTAMP:20260604T022443Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260801
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260802
SUMMARY:Puriva Aesthetic Clinic — SEO Retainer Month 3 (10 tasks)
DESCRIPTION:Puriva Aesthetic Clinic — Month 3 SEO retainer tasks:\n- Optimised heavy homepage assets to improve load speeds.\n- Verified that Rich Snippets are still displaying in search results.\n- Configured lazy loading for below-the-fold images to improve initial page load.\n- Checked for 'Mixed Content' security warnings across the site.\n- Audited H1 and H2 tags on service pages for better relevance.\n- Audited the backlink profile in Semrush and prepared a disavow file to protect the site from toxic or spammy domains.\n- Conducted UI/UX check across different mobile browsers.\n- Updated alt-text on recent project images and blog posts.\n- Checked 'Core Web Vitals' report for new mobile performance issues.\n- Verified SSL certificate status and auto-renewal settings.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:dm-seo-retainer-puriva-aesthetic-clinic-m4@digitalmovement
DTSTAMP:20260604T022443Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260901
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260902
SUMMARY:Puriva Aesthetic Clinic — SEO Retainer Month 4 (10 tasks)
DESCRIPTION:Puriva Aesthetic Clinic — Month 4 SEO retainer tasks:\n- Optimised browser cache-control policies for static assets to reduce server load.\n- Integrated real-time uptime monitoring with automated downtime alerts for immediate response.\n- Checked for keyword cannibalisation on the main ranking pages.\n- Audited About and Contact pages for NAP consistency.\n- Cross-referenced the HTML user sitemap against the XML sitemap to ensure all public pages are discoverable by both users and bots.\n- Refined internal linking structure in the sidebar and footer.\n- Scanned for new 'soft 404' errors in Search Console.\n- Updated the copyright year and legal links in the footer.\n- Reviewed the GSC 'Discover' report for organic traffic spikes.\n- Verified the site favicon is displaying correctly in Google mobile results.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:dm-seo-retainer-puriva-aesthetic-clinic-m5@digitalmovement
DTSTAMP:20260604T022443Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261001
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261002
SUMMARY:Puriva Aesthetic Clinic — SEO Retainer Month 5 (10 tasks)
DESCRIPTION:Puriva Aesthetic Clinic — Month 5 SEO retainer tasks:\n- Performed technical validation on structured data to ensure rich snippet eligibility.\n- Verified GTM data layer variables to ensure accurate lead source attribution in GA4.\n- Audited the site's 'Page Experience' score in GSC.\n- Enabled server-level caching and cleared redundant CSS files.\n- Tested 'Click to Call' buttons on mobile to ensure they trigger.\n- Scanned for any hidden text or 'ghost' elements in the code.\n- Checked indexing status for 'Crawl but not indexed' pages.\n- Audited firewall event logs to identify and block suspicious IP ranges.\n- Monitored 'Images' tab in Search Console for new traffic gains.\n- Verified the enquiry 'Success Page' is tracking accurately in GA4.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:dm-seo-retainer-puriva-aesthetic-clinic-m6@digitalmovement
DTSTAMP:20260604T022443Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261101
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261102
SUMMARY:Puriva Aesthetic Clinic — SEO Retainer Month 6 (10 tasks)
DESCRIPTION:Puriva Aesthetic Clinic — Month 6 SEO retainer tasks:\n- Re-submitted updated sitemap to reflect recent site changes.\n- Finalised cleanup of 'Unassigned' traffic sources in GA4.\n- Manual walk-through of the conversion funnel to find friction.\n- Checked for duplicate content issues using Screaming Frog.\n- Verified lead source attribution for all website contact forms.\n- Verified no accidental 'No-Follow' tags were added to key pages.\n- Scanned for any outdated plugin or script alerts in the backend.\n- Validated GA4 event parameter mapping for custom conversion tracking.\n- Checked GSC 'Indexing' reports for any non-indexed priority URLs.\n- Reviewed top-performing page titles for character truncation in mobile SERPs.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:dm-seo-retainer-puriva-aesthetic-clinic-m7@digitalmovement
DTSTAMP:20260604T022443Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261201
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261202
SUMMARY:Puriva Aesthetic Clinic — SEO Retainer Month 7 (10 tasks)
DESCRIPTION:Puriva Aesthetic Clinic — Month 7 SEO retainer tasks:\n- Audited internal link anchor text for keyword variety.\n- Cleaned up redundant or outdated tags in Google Tag Manager.\n- Checked for broken outbound links to external websites.\n- Monitored for any new 'soft 404' errors appearing in GSC.\n- Reviewed page-level engagement time for main service pages in GA4.\n- Verified that image alt-text across the site is descriptive and active.\n- Scanned for any hidden CSS or JavaScript blocking indexation.\n- Benchmarked domain authority against local industry rivals in Semrush.\n- Verified that the XML sitemap is excluded from being indexed itself.\n- Checked for any 'orphan pages' using a Screaming Frog crawl.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:dm-seo-retainer-puriva-aesthetic-clinic-m8@digitalmovement
DTSTAMP:20260604T022443Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270101
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270102
SUMMARY:Puriva Aesthetic Clinic — SEO Retainer Month 8 (10 tasks)
DESCRIPTION:Puriva Aesthetic Clinic — Month 8 SEO retainer tasks:\n- Performed technical check on schema markup for FAQ or Review snippets.\n- Tested the site's layout to make sure important pages aren't buried too deep for users to find.\n- Checked for any unintended 'noindex' tags in the source code.\n- Verified that canonical tags are pointing to the correct URLs.\n- Reviewed server uptime logs to ensure 99.9% availability.\n- Tested site navigation on various tablet and mobile devices.\n- Reviewed the 'Pages' report in GSC for any crawl budget waste.\n- Checked for any mixed-content warnings after recent site updates.\n- Verified SSL certificate chain integrity and forced HTTPS redirection to prevent insecure connections.\n- Audited the site's internal search function for relevant results.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:dm-seo-retainer-puriva-aesthetic-clinic-m9@digitalmovement
DTSTAMP:20260604T022443Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270201
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270202
SUMMARY:Puriva Aesthetic Clinic — SEO Retainer Month 9 (10 tasks)
DESCRIPTION:Puriva Aesthetic Clinic — Month 9 SEO retainer tasks:\n- Ran malware scans using Wordfence to detect and resolve potential security threats.\n- Verified that lead form 'Thank You' pages are noindexed.\n- Checked the site's 404 page for helpful navigation links.\n- Monitored for any sudden increases in crawl rate from Googlebot.\n- Reviewed mobile 'Page Experience' signals in Search Console.\n- Verified that GTM events are capturing the correct lead source data.\n- Audited the site's font loading to prevent layout shifts.\n- Checked for any 'thin content' pages that need merging or expansion.\n- Scanned for any expired or invalid tracking scripts in the header.\n- Verified that the site's 'About' page matches current brand info.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:dm-seo-retainer-puriva-aesthetic-clinic-m10@digitalmovement
DTSTAMP:20260604T022443Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270301
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270302
SUMMARY:Puriva Aesthetic Clinic — SEO Retainer Month 10 (10 tasks)
DESCRIPTION:Puriva Aesthetic Clinic — Month 10 SEO retainer tasks:\n- Audited GTM audience triggers for specific user actions.\n- Checked for any crawl errors related to the site's CSS or JS files.\n- Verified that the site's SSL certificate is valid across all subdomains.\n- Scanned for any 'noarchive' or 'nosnippet' tags in the code.\n- Monitored Search Console for any new 'Merchant Listings' errors.\n- Reviewed the site's internal linking from the homepage to sub-pages.\n- Checked for any broken links in the site's navigation menu.\n- Verified that the site's favicon is appearing in all major browsers.\n- Audited the site's robots.txt for any outdated disallow rules.\n- Optimised cache-control headers for static assets (JS\, CSS\, Fonts).
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:dm-seo-retainer-puriva-aesthetic-clinic-m11@digitalmovement
DTSTAMP:20260604T022443Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270401
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270402
SUMMARY:Puriva Aesthetic Clinic — SEO Retainer Month 11 (10 tasks)
DESCRIPTION:Puriva Aesthetic Clinic — Month 11 SEO retainer tasks:\n- Validated site-wide Open Graph tags for social media sharing.\n- Checked for any new 'Crawl anomalies' in the GSC report.\n- Verified that all contact form fields are correctly mapped for tracking.\n- Scanned for any duplicate H1 tags across the service pages.\n- Monitored for any new backlinks in Semrush from high-authority sources.\n- Reviewed the site's performance on low-bandwidth connections.\n- Checked for any 'Redirect chains' that slow down the user journey.\n- Audited the site's footer for consistent branding and links.\n- Verified that the site's sitemap is listed in the robots.txt file.\n- Checked for any unintended 'sponsored' or 'ugc' link attributes.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:dm-seo-retainer-puriva-aesthetic-clinic-m12@digitalmovement
DTSTAMP:20260604T022443Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270501
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270502
SUMMARY:Puriva Aesthetic Clinic — SEO Retainer Month 12 (10 tasks)
DESCRIPTION:Puriva Aesthetic Clinic — Month 12 SEO retainer tasks:\n- Performed annual technical health check using Screaming Frog.\n- Re-submitted the XML sitemap to ensure the latest index is fresh.\n- Finalised cleanup of any lingering tracking or analytics errors in GA4.\n- Conducted a manual audit of the end-to-end user conversion path.\n- Checked for any new 'Security issues' flagged in Search Console.\n- Verified that the site's meta-data is consistent across all service areas.\n- Scanned for any outdated content that needs a refresh or removal.\n- Audited the site's overall mobile-friendliness and accessibility.\n- Verified that all GTM tags are firing on the correct triggers.\n- Re-confirmed the site's technical readiness for the next yearly cycle.
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
